Object.assign(ENEMIES,{yan:{name:"Yan Shuo, Inner Court Genius",hp:24,open:"Yan Shuo salutes, fist to palm. \u201CShow me what you hide, servant.\u201D",
  moves:[{n:"Azure sword arc",d:5},{n:"Cloud-step palm",d:4},{n:"Sword qi gathering",kind:"charge",text:"Azure light runs up his blade like water flowing backward.",tele:"Sword qi gathers along his edge."},{n:"Azure Severance",d:9,kind:"release"}]}});


SC["a1c6_watcher"]={t:()=>SYS(`CHAPTER SIX — THE FROZEN STREAM`)+P(`Deep winter, and you have developed a new sense the way you develop a bruise: slowly, and then all at once. You are being watched.`)+P(`This is not the basement's ordinary watching; gossip has eyes everywhere, and you've learned to live in them. Something else has found you. Single. Patient. It arrives some mornings on the laundry path and leaves with the noon bell, and it never, ever gossips, because gossip would come back to you, and nothing comes back at all. Silence like that isn't an absence. It's discipline.`)+((G.insight>=6)?(P(`So one grey morning you let a mended bucket-stave fail on purpose — and reweave it slowly, sloppily, in the open, your gold knots crawling like honey. The watching sharpens to a point you could hang a coat on. There: the cedar shadow above the wash-stairs. Tall. Still as a sword in a rack. You finish the stave, look directly at the shadow, and bow exactly the depth a servant owes an inner disciple.`)+P(`The shadow laughs — one short, startled note — and steps into the light.`)):(P(`You never do spot the source, and that's the part that keeps you up at night: the basement sees everything, and the basement sees nothing, which means whoever it is stands somewhere the basement doesn't look. Above it.`)+P(`When the watcher finally chooses to be seen, it's on his terms, not yours.`))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`The watcher has a name, and the whole mountain knows it.`,do:()=>{if(G.insight>=6){G.f.a1_spotted=true;addIns(1);};},go:"a1c6_pre"}]};

SC["a1c6_pre"]={t:()=>P(`Yan Shuo. Seventeen, inner court, the genius the elders polish like a jewel. You know the name the way the basement knows all its weather.`)+P(`What you learn in the days that follow, watching him back, is stranger than the watching: he has been <i>investigating</i>. He walked the medicine garden's wall, alone, in the snow, and stood a long time over the spot where a bait-pot used to be. He asked the discipline board's clerk for last season's fine rolls — and read them, all of them, standing up. He paid a chandler for tea and asked no questions anyone could overhear, which is the loudest kind of asking there is.`)+P(`He is doing to the garden's story what you did to it. He is just doing it slower, without thread-sight, on honor alone — a boy auditing the mountain because some instinct told him the books don't balance.`)+P(`“He duels on the stream when it freezes hard,” Bao reports, unasked, with the air of a man delivering tactical intelligence. “Every winter. Says ice doesn't flatter anyone's footwork.” A pause. “He's never lost up there, gold-hair.”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`The stream froze hard a week ago.`,go:"c2_yan"}]};

SC["c2_yan"]={t:()=>DIV+P(`You are beating laundry by the frozen stream when a shadow falls across the ice: Yan Shuo. Inner court. Sword-spine straight — and he is looking at the laundry paddle in your hand, which is currently held together by a knot of faint gold light where it cracked yesterday.`)+((G.f.a1_spotted)?(P(`“You bowed to a shadow,” he says, without preamble. “Which means you found me when no one on this mountain finds me. I have watched you mend what cannot be mended and trip what cannot be tripped, and I have told no one.”`)):(P(`“I watched you fight the weasel from the wall,” he says, without preamble. “I have told no one.”`)))+P(`“A cripple who does what you do is either a demon's puppet or a new path under Heaven, and I want to know which before Elder Kang does.” He draws his sword and lays it flat across his palms — a formal challenge, the honorable kind. “Duel me. Show me everything. I will keep your secret either way — but I will have the truth of you.”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Accept the duel. Hold nothing back.`,go:"c2_duel"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Refuse — and try to talk him down instead.`,req:()=>(G.heart>=4),rq:"(needs Heart 4)",do:()=>{G.yan+=1;G.f.yanTalked=true;},go:"c2_duel_talk"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Refuse.`,hide:()=>(G.heart>=4),go:"c2_duel_forced"}]};

SC["c2_duel_talk"]={t:()=>P(`You set down the paddle and tell him — not everything, but enough. Another sky. A death. A loom. He listens the way he sword-drills: totally.`)+P(`“A whole other Heaven,” he says at last, wonder cracking his court manners, “and it sent us <i>you</i>.” He sheathes the blade. “Then I withdraw the challenge and ask instead: spar with me, as equals, when the stream thaws. And watch Elder Kang. He has been asking the stewards about you by name.”`)+SYS(`Yan Shuo becomes something rarer than a rival: a believer.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.yan+=2;note("Yan Shuo +2");G.f.yanRespect=true;},go:"a1c6_fallout"}]};

SC["c2_duel_forced"]={t:()=>P(`“No,” you say. Yan Shuo's eyes narrow. “Then I must assume demon's puppet,” he says, with real regret, and the sword comes up. “Defend yourself.”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`The duel comes whether you want it or not.`,go:"c2_duel"}]};

SC["c2_duel"]={combat:"yan",
 win:"c2_duel_win",
 lose:"c2_duel_lose",
 t:()=>P(`The frozen stream becomes a dueling ground. He gives you the first move, because of course he does.`)};

SC["c2_duel_win"]={t:()=>P(`It ends with his sword spinning away across the ice and a snare-knot around his wrist. For three heartbeats the only sound is the stream under the ice.`)+P(`Then Yan Shuo starts to laugh — a real laugh, the first you've heard from him. “A new path under Heaven,” he says, saluting with his bound hand, fist to palm. “I am answered. Your secret is mine to guard now, weaver. And — listen. Elder Kang has been asking about you. Whatever he wants, it is not to give you a prize.”`)+SYS(`Victory. Yan Shuo's respect, won at sword's edge, is iron.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.yan+=2;note("Yan Shuo +2");G.f.yanRespect=true;G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c6_fallout"}]};

SC["c2_duel_lose"]={t:()=>P(`He is, in the end, the genius of the Azure Cloud Sect, and you are one winter into an art you invented in a kitchen yard. The flat of his blade taps your collarbone: match point.`)+P(`But he is breathing hard, and there are four golden welts across his sword arm, and the look he gives you is nothing like contempt. “One winter, self-taught, no manual, no master,” he says, sheathing. “I needed nine years to make a senior brother breathe like this. Keep your secret, weaver. Grow. And watch Elder Kang — he has been asking the stewards about you by name.”`)+SYS(`Defeat with honor. Sometimes that buys more than victory.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.yan+=1;note("Yan Shuo +1");addIns(1);G.hp=G.maxhp;},go:"a1c6_fallout"}]};

SC["a1c6_fallout"]={t:()=>P(`The frozen stream is supposed to be private. You duel there when you don't want witnesses.`)+P(`But winters are long, basements talk, and Liu Feng has debts — his patron's fine still bleeding, his standing in his cohort gone soft since the water-yard. A story about the gold-haired servant and the inner court's jewel is worth real coin to the right buyer, and Feng has spent a season learning exactly where the right buyers drink.`)+P(`He doesn't even get the story right. That's the part you'll remember later, when you can think about it without your jaw tightening: the version that goes up the mountain is wrong in every detail that matters and right in the only one that does — <i>the cripple in the kitchens is not what the jade said he was.</i>`)+P(`You did everything carefully. You were kind where kindness was cheap and quiet where quiet was free, and none of it mattered, because being seen was never something you could choose your way out of. It was only ever something you could delay.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Winter turns. Word climbs.`,go:"a1c6_summons"}]};

SC["a1c6_summons"]={t:()=>P(`The steward who finds you at the woks on the last day of winter is a stranger, not Qiu: up-mountain, grey-robed, courteous as a locked door, and he does not bring a summons — that will come later, in spring, with a tournament attached. He brings only a question, read from a slip of paper: <i>confirm the name of the gold-haired servant, written as it is spoken.</i>`)+P(`He inks your name into a little iron-grey book — you watch your whole self become four strokes and a flourish in a stranger's handwriting — bows precisely nothing, and climbs back into the cloud.`)+((G.f.a1_intent==="even")?(P(`Good, you think, before you can stop yourself, cold and clear as the stream under the ice. <i>Look at me. Look closely. I'm looking back.</i>`)):(((G.f.a1_intent==="safe")?(P(`You stand at the woks with your heart going like a hare, doing the only arithmetic that matters: how long does an unnoticed life last, once it's in a book?`)):(P(`You stand at the woks a long time, watching the cloud he vanished into, feeling the mountain's attention settle over you like the first weight of snow.`)))))+P(`Granny Sho sweeps past behind you, once, and does not stop. “Sweep faster, boy,” she says, to the courtyard, to the winter, to the iron-grey book climbing the thousand steps.`)+SYS(`END OF ACT ONE. Your name is on the mountain now. In spring: the Azure Trials.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Spring comes anyway. It always does.`,go:"c3t_open"}]};